WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
The customer chooses a service.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.440
The customer selects an available appointment time.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.880
Tori displays an in-app booking confirmation.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.240
The same appointment appears in the business calendar.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.520
The owner changes Sunday’s closing time to noon.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.000
The revised hours leave only morning times available.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.400
A separate mobile session shows appointment selection.
